// ## 4. std/ hot paths (informational)

// std/ has no perf harness. The 5905-file standard library has
// hot paths (repl_engine.oo, actor_mesh_runtime.oo, frame_loop.oo,
// list_*.oo, str_*.oo) but no `qa/probe_perf_benchmark.oo` or
// similar exists to measure them. Building a perf harness for
// std/ is **multi-session work** (probe per hot path + golden
// values per algorithm + double-run per probe). Deferred to a
// follow-up session.

// This is a real gap: any user claiming "std/ is fast" has no
// evidence trail. **FINDING n1** below.

